            "title": "Empty or root-resolving input now raises ValueError instead of returning a path",
            "category": "edge_case",
            "path": "app/review_26.py",
            "start_line": 4,
            "end_line": 4,
            "trigger_condition": "transform('') or transform('.') or any value whose resolved target equals the root directory /srv/files.",
            "impact": "Previously transform('') returned '/srv/files/' and transform('.') returned '/srv/files/.'; now both raise ValueError('outside root') because root not in target.parents. This is a regression for callers using the root directory.",
